    "answer": {
      "short": "Ross: $75\\%$; Marsha: $72\\%$. Ross obtained the higher mark because $75\\%>72\\%$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Ross's score}&=\\frac{45}{60}\\times100\\%\\\\&=75\\%\\\\\\text{Marsha's score}&=\\frac{72}{100}\\times100\\%\\\\&=72\\%\\end{align*}$$\nRoss obtained the higher mark because $75\\%>72\\%$.",
